.TH "nikak-by-yeoldelaptopsposseskoyp" "6" "2026-11-15" "nikak User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
nikak-by-yeoldelaptopsposseskoyp - the command to run nikak.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
nikak-by-yeoldelaptopsposseskoyp
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
nikak is a 4k intro released by Ye Olde Laptops Posse & s.k.o.y.p in
August 2017.
It ranked 5th in the PC 4k compo at Evoke 2017.
.PP
provod [code] keen [music]
.PP
The intro is rendered at 1280x720 and scaled to the window size, keeping
its aspect ratio.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]F\f[R]
toggle fullscreen (desktop resolution)
.TP
\f[B]Esc\f[R]
quit
